<para>This function uses ImGui to draw a series of controls for modifying the <ref refid="struct_a_g_e_1_1_box_properties" kindref="compound">BoxProperties</ref> of the <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_button_component" kindref="compound">ButtonComponent</ref>. It includes fields for Screen Position, Screen Rotation, Screen Scale and Box Color. The <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_u_i_component_1af6baa3f8d5e27906bb0cf5505920323d" kindref="member">DrawVec3Control</ref> is used to handle <ref refid="struct_a_g_e_1_1_vector3" kindref="compound">Vector3</ref> properties.</para>
